# INVWINNB.KEY - a key script of INVWIN, as INVWIN.KEY: the location and
# service forms' notes, and the notes at level 1.  Shelf A1's notes are
# typed over two lines and saved, then shown again as saved by CTRL+E,
# and a third line added at their end and saved shows too; a change to
# the notes alone makes ESC ask first; a new location is added with
# notes, which show when it is shown again.  Service record 1's seeded
# notes show in view mode, and a line added to them and saved shows too.
# At level 1 (READER) item 1's notes show in view mode, and typing into
# them changes nothing; the end by Exit.  TEST/GOLDEN/WIN/INVWINNB.SNP is
# its snapshot.
T ADMIN
K TAB
T Retro1986
K ENTER
K ALT-L B DOWN
# Shelf A1: the notes reached by their page's letter, typed and saved
K CTRL-E ALT-N
S NOTES
T Top shelf, left
K CTRL-ENTER
T Keep dry
K ENTER
S SAVED
K CTRL-E
S REOPEN
K ESC
# a third line at the end of the notes
K CTRL-E ALT-N CEND CTRL-ENTER
T Checked in October
K ENTER CTRL-E
S THIRD
K ESC
# the notes alone changed: ESC asks, Yes leaves them unsaved
K CTRL-E ALT-N
T x
K ESC
S ASK
K Y CTRL-E
S KEPT
K ESC
# a new location with notes, shown again
K INS
T C3
K ALT-N
T Steel cabinet
K ENTER
S ADDED
K END CTRL-E
S NEWVIEW
K ESC
# service record 1: its notes shown, a line added and saved
K ESC ALT-I E ENTER
S SVCVIEW
K ENTER CTRL-E CPGDN CEND CTRL-ENTER
T Fan replaced too
K ENTER ENTER
S SVCSAVED
K ENTER ESC
# level 1: the notes shown, read-only
K ALT-F L STAB
T READER
K TAB
T Reader1986
K ENTER ENTER
S READER
K CPGUP PGDN
T x
S READRO
K ENTER ALT-F X
